{"id":"0fc14f4a062b4abf","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fhodtt-term-model.md","title":"两 sort 判断商与严格句法模型","display":"df-fhodtt-term-model — 两 sort 判断商与严格句法模型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"11","label":"16-df-fhodtt-term-model","aliases":["16-df-fhodtt-term-model"],"display":"df-fhodtt-term-model — 两 sort 判断商与严格句法模型","depends_on":["[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]","[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]"],"source":"§11.5 pp.688–691; explicit quotient construction for the supplied split rule presentation","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fhodtt-term-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fhodtt-term-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fhodtt-term-model — 两 sort 判断商与严格句法模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f94e7143755d4851\" href=\"?note=f94e7143755d4851\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model\">16-df-fhodtt-cat-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.5 pp.688–691; explicit quotient construction for the supplied split rule presentation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a> 的有限推导关系，省略固定下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\">\\(\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\)</span>。语境的声明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_i,s_i,C_i)\">\\((x_i,s_i,C_i)\\)</span> 保留 sort 标签，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_i)_{i\\ge1}\">\\((x_i)_{i\\ge1}\\)</span>，语境声明变量按位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 同名；内部绑定变量取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\">\\(s,t,u\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\\)</span>。所有商均为集合的商；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[z]_{\\sim}\">\\([z]_{\\sim}\\)</span> 是相应等价类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]\">\\([\\Gamma]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\">\\([(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\)</span> 分别按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx,\\sim_S\">\\(\\approx,\\sim_S\\)</span> 取类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[(\\Gamma,C)]_s\">\\([(\\Gamma,C)]_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[(\\Gamma,C,e)]_s\">\\([(\\Gamma,C,e)]_s\\)</span> 分别按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{A,s},\\sim_{E,s}\">\\(\\sim_{A,s},\\sim_{E,s}\\)</span> 取类，故方括号的每种论域都有明确关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\">\\(\\sigma:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Theta\">\\(\\tau:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Theta\\)</span> 是上游的良型替换判断。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma\\equiv\\tau:\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma\\equiv\\tau:\\Delta\\)</span> 由下文逐分量定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{&lt;i}\">\\(\\Delta_{&lt;i}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x_{&lt;i}\">\\(\\vec x_{&lt;i}\\)</span> 是前缀；对规范语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i^\\Gamma,C_i^\\Gamma\">\\(s_i^\\Gamma,C_i^\\Gamma\\)</span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个声明的 sort 与表达式分量，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=((x_i,s_i^\\Gamma,C_i^\\Gamma))_{i=1}^{|\\Gamma|}\">\\(\\Gamma=((x_i,s_i^\\Gamma,C_i^\\Gamma))_{i=1}^{|\\Gamma|}\\)</span>。类型、项与替换的商关系同时记录相等语境，不选择一个隐含的语境代表。</li>\n<li>范畴、集合族、重索引和各项操作的目标格式采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"241e7e90b85de13e\" href=\"?note=241e7e90b85de13e\" title=\"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure\">16-df-split-fhodtt-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}\\)</span> 和递归解释采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f94e7143755d4851\" href=\"?note=f94e7143755d4851\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model\">16-df-fhodtt-cat-model</a>。下式不是把句法模型性放进前提，而是先给全部分量再断言它满足结构公理。</li>\n<li>操作公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=[(\\Gamma,C)]_s\">\\(A=[(\\Gamma,C)]_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=[(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D)]_t\">\\(B=[(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D)]_t\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,f,p,d\">\\(a,b,f,p,d\\)</span> 代表相应型属的项类，构造子保留其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,x.D,z.E)\">\\((C,x.D,z.E)\\)</span> 注释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D\">\\(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D\\)</span> 是语境与表达式的参数分隔记法，不是新的语法构造。需要同一语境时使用下述商关系中的语境转换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda x:C.b\">\\(\\lambda x:C.b\\)</span> 等缩写只省略这里已经固定的注释。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x_{|\\Gamma|+1}\">\\(x=x_{|\\Gamma|+1}\\)</span>，双扩张的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=x_{|\\Gamma|+2}\">\\(y=x_{|\\Gamma|+2}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 是同一个单扩张位置的新鲜变量名。末尾解释公式对所有已良型的显示判断分别普遍闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}\\mid\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma&#39;&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;\\in\\mathsf C\\land|\\Gamma|=|\\Gamma&#39;|\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\Gamma|\\})\\\n\\bigl[s_i^\\Gamma=s_i^{\\Gamma&#39;}\\land\n\\Gamma_{&lt;i}\\vdash C_i^\\Gamma\\equiv C_i^{\\Gamma&#39;}:s_i^\\Gamma\\bigr],\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\vec a\\equiv\\vec b:\\Delta\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\vec a:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\land\\vec b:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\Delta|\\})\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash a_i\\equiv b_i:C_i^\\Delta[\\vec a_{&lt;i}/\\vec x_{&lt;i}],\\\\\n\\mathsf S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf C\\land\n\\sigma:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf A_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,C)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf C\\land\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf E_s&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\Gamma,C,e)\\mid(\\Gamma,C)\\in\\mathsf A_s\\land\\Gamma\\vdash e:C\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}\\mid\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma&#39;&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;\\in\\mathsf C\\land|\\Gamma|=|\\Gamma&#39;|\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\Gamma|\\})\\\n\\bigl[s_i^\\Gamma=s_i^{\\Gamma&#39;}\\land\n\\Gamma_{&lt;i}\\vdash C_i^\\Gamma\\equiv C_i^{\\Gamma&#39;}:s_i^\\Gamma\\bigr],\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\vec a\\equiv\\vec b:\\Delta\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\vec a:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\land\\vec b:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\Delta|\\})\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash a_i\\equiv b_i:C_i^\\Delta[\\vec a_{&lt;i}/\\vec x_{&lt;i}],\\\\\n\\mathsf S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf C\\land\n\\sigma:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf A_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,C)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf C\\land\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf E_s&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\Gamma,C,e)\\mid(\\Gamma,C)\\in\\mathsf A_s\\land\\Gamma\\vdash e:C\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\sim_S(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\tau)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma),(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf S\n\\land\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma&#39;\\land\\Delta\\approx\\Delta&#39;\n\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma\\equiv\\tau:\\Delta,\\\\\n(\\Gamma,C)\\sim_{A,s}(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,C),(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;)\\in\\mathsf A_s\n\\land\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma&#39;\\land\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv C&#39;:s,\\\\\n(\\Gamma,C,e)\\sim_{E,s}(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;,e&#39;)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,C,e),(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;,e&#39;)\\in\\mathsf E_s\n\\land\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma&#39;\\land\n\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv C&#39;:s\\land\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;:C.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\sim_S(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\tau)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma),(\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta&#39;,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf S\n\\land\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma&#39;\\land\\Delta\\approx\\Delta&#39;\n\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma\\equiv\\tau:\\Delta,\\\\\n(\\Gamma,C)\\sim_{A,s}(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,C),(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;)\\in\\mathsf A_s\n\\land\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma&#39;\\land\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv C&#39;:s,\\\\\n(\\Gamma,C,e)\\sim_{E,s}(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;,e&#39;)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,C,e),(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;,e&#39;)\\in\\mathsf E_s\n\\land\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma&#39;\\land\n\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv C&#39;:s\\land\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;:C.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\mathrm g}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C/{\\approx},\\qquad\nM_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S/{\\sim_S},\\\\\ns_{\\mathrm g}[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&amp;\\coloneqq[\\Gamma],\\qquad\nt_{\\mathrm g}[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\coloneqq[\\Delta],\\\\\ne_{\\mathrm g}[\\Gamma]&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Gamma,(x_i)_{i=1}^{|\\Gamma|})],\\\\\nc_{\\mathrm g}([(\\Delta&#39;,\\Theta,\\tau)],[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)])\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\tau[\\sigma])]\n\\quad(\\Delta&#39;\\approx\\Delta),\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm g}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle O_{\\mathrm g},M_{\\mathrm g},s_{\\mathrm g},t_{\\mathrm g},e_{\\mathrm g},c_{\\mathrm g}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq[()],\\\\\n!_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(),())],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ty}^{\\mathrm g}_s([\\Gamma])\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,C)]_{\\sim_{A,s}}\\mid\n(\\Gamma&#39;,C)\\in\\mathsf A_s\\land\\Gamma&#39;\\approx\\Gamma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tm}^{\\mathrm g}_s([\\Gamma],[(\\Gamma,C)])\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;,e)]_{\\sim_{E,s}}\\mid\n(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;,e)\\in\\mathsf E_s\\land(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;)\\sim_{A,s}(\\Gamma,C)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\mathrm g}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C/{\\approx},\\qquad\nM_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S/{\\sim_S},\\\\\ns_{\\mathrm g}[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&amp;\\coloneqq[\\Gamma],\\qquad\nt_{\\mathrm g}[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\coloneqq[\\Delta],\\\\\ne_{\\mathrm g}[\\Gamma]&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Gamma,(x_i)_{i=1}^{|\\Gamma|})],\\\\\nc_{\\mathrm g}([(\\Delta&#39;,\\Theta,\\tau)],[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)])\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\tau[\\sigma])]\n\\quad(\\Delta&#39;\\approx\\Delta),\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm g}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle O_{\\mathrm g},M_{\\mathrm g},s_{\\mathrm g},t_{\\mathrm g},e_{\\mathrm g},c_{\\mathrm g}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq[()],\\\\\n!_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(),())],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ty}^{\\mathrm g}_s([\\Gamma])\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,C)]_{\\sim_{A,s}}\\mid\n(\\Gamma&#39;,C)\\in\\mathsf A_s\\land\\Gamma&#39;\\approx\\Gamma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tm}^{\\mathrm g}_s([\\Gamma],[(\\Gamma,C)])\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;,e)]_{\\sim_{E,s}}\\mid\n(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;,e)\\in\\mathsf E_s\\land(\\Gamma&#39;,C&#39;)\\sim_{A,s}(\\Gamma,C)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n[(\\Delta,C)]_s\\bigl[\\,[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\,\\bigr]\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,C[\\sigma])]_s,\\\\\n[(\\Delta,C,e)]_s\\bigl[\\,[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\,\\bigr]\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,C[\\sigma],e[\\sigma])]_s,\\\\\n[\\Gamma]\\triangleright_s[(\\Gamma,C)]_s\n&amp;\\coloneqq[\\Gamma,(x,s,C)],\\\\\np^s_{[(\\Gamma,C)]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);\\Gamma;(x_i)_{i=1}^{|\\Gamma|})],\\\\\nq^s_{[(\\Gamma,C)]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);C;x)]_s,\\\\\n\\langle[(\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\sigma)],[(\\Delta,C[\\sigma],a)]_s\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Delta;\\Gamma,(x,s,C);(\\sigma,a))],\\\\\n1^s_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1_s)]_s,\\qquad\n*^s_{[\\Gamma]}\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1_s,()_s)]_s,\\\\\n\\Omega_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type})]_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_{[\\Gamma]}([(\\Gamma,C)]_{\\mathsf{Type}})\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type},C)]_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{El}_{[\\Gamma]}([(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type},C)]_{\\mathsf{Kind}})\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,C)]_{\\mathsf{Type}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n[(\\Delta,C)]_s\\bigl[\\,[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\,\\bigr]\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,C[\\sigma])]_s,\\\\\n[(\\Delta,C,e)]_s\\bigl[\\,[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\,\\bigr]\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,C[\\sigma],e[\\sigma])]_s,\\\\\n[\\Gamma]\\triangleright_s[(\\Gamma,C)]_s\n&amp;\\coloneqq[\\Gamma,(x,s,C)],\\\\\np^s_{[(\\Gamma,C)]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);\\Gamma;(x_i)_{i=1}^{|\\Gamma|})],\\\\\nq^s_{[(\\Gamma,C)]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);C;x)]_s,\\\\\n\\langle[(\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\sigma)],[(\\Delta,C[\\sigma],a)]_s\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Delta;\\Gamma,(x,s,C);(\\sigma,a))],\\\\\n1^s_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1_s)]_s,\\qquad\n*^s_{[\\Gamma]}\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1_s,()_s)]_s,\\\\\n\\Omega_{[\\Gamma]}&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type})]_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_{[\\Gamma]}([(\\Gamma,C)]_{\\mathsf{Type}})\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type},C)]_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{El}_{[\\Gamma]}([(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type},C)]_{\\mathsf{Kind}})\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,C)]_{\\mathsf{Type}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm g}^{s,t}(A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n[(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C).D)]_t\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n\\lambda^{s,t}_{A,B}([(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D;b)]_t)\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma;\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D;\n\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))]_t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\n[(\\Gamma,\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D,f)]_t,[(\\Gamma,C,a)]_s)\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma;D[a/x];\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(f,a))]_t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\n[(\\Gamma,C,a)]_s,[(\\Gamma,D[a/x],b)]_t)\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma;\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D;\n\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))]_t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,[(\\Gamma,(z,t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D);E)]_u}^{s,t,u}\n([(\\Gamma,(x,s,C),(y,t,D);E[(x,y)/z];d)]_u)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n[(\\Gamma,(z,t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D);E;\n\\operatorname{split}_{C,x.D,z.E}^{s,t,u}(z;x,y.d))]_u\n\\quad((s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm g}^{s,t}(A,B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n[(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C).D)]_t\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n\\lambda^{s,t}_{A,B}([(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D;b)]_t)\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma;\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D;\n\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))]_t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\n[(\\Gamma,\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D,f)]_t,[(\\Gamma,C,a)]_s)\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma;D[a/x];\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(f,a))]_t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\n[(\\Gamma,C,a)]_s,[(\\Gamma,D[a/x],b)]_t)\n&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma;\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D;\n\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))]_t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,[(\\Gamma,(z,t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D);E)]_u}^{s,t,u}\n([(\\Gamma,(x,s,C),(y,t,D);E[(x,y)/z];d)]_u)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n[(\\Gamma,(z,t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D);E;\n\\operatorname{split}_{C,x.D,z.E}^{s,t,u}(z;x,y.d))]_u\n\\quad((s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nS_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm g},\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm g},!,&amp;\n(\\operatorname{Ty}^{\\mathrm g}_s,\\operatorname{Tm}^{\\mathrm g}_s,\n[-],\\triangleright_s,p^s,q^s,\\langle-,-\\rangle,1^s,*^s)_{s\\in\\mathcal S},\\\\\n&amp;\\Omega,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{El},\n(\\Pi_{\\mathrm g}^{s,t},\\lambda^{s,t},\\operatorname{app}^{s,t},\n\\Sigma_{\\mathrm g}^{s,t},\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t})_{s,t\\in\\mathcal S},\n(\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u})_{(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\\rangle .\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nS_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm g},\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm g},!,&amp;\n(\\operatorname{Ty}^{\\mathrm g}_s,\\operatorname{Tm}^{\\mathrm g}_s,\n[-],\\triangleright_s,p^s,q^s,\\langle-,-\\rangle,1^s,*^s)_{s\\in\\mathcal S},\\\\\n&amp;\\Omega,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{El},\n(\\Pi_{\\mathrm g}^{s,t},\\lambda^{s,t},\\operatorname{app}^{s,t},\n\\Sigma_{\\mathrm g}^{s,t},\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t})_{s,t\\in\\mathcal S},\n(\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u})_{(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\\rangle .\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S_{\\mathrm g}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S_{\\mathrm g}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}&amp;\\Longrightarrow⟦\\Gamma⟧_{S_{\\mathrm g}}=[\\Gamma],\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash C:s&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧^s_{S_{\\mathrm g},\\Gamma}=[(\\Gamma,C)]_s,\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s)\\land(\\Gamma\\vdash e:C)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash e:C⟧_{S_{\\mathrm g}}\n=[(\\Gamma,C,e)]_s,\\\\\n\\sigma:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n⟦\\sigma⟧_{S_{\\mathrm g}}=[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}&amp;\\Longrightarrow⟦\\Gamma⟧_{S_{\\mathrm g}}=[\\Gamma],\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash C:s&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧^s_{S_{\\mathrm g},\\Gamma}=[(\\Gamma,C)]_s,\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s)\\land(\\Gamma\\vdash e:C)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash e:C⟧_{S_{\\mathrm g}}\n=[(\\Gamma,C,e)]_s,\\\\\n\\sigma:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n⟦\\sigma⟧_{S_{\\mathrm g}}=[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上下文转换和判断等式的等价、同余规则使三个关系及语境关系成为等价关系。对等式和替换的有限推导相互归纳，得到等式替换的功能性；于是类型、项、替换的代表同时更换时，所列重索引和构造结果仍在同一个类中。上下文也取逐声明判断相等商，所以相等类型引起的语境扩张严格相等，不需要暗中选择类型代表。</p>\n<p>范畴律由有限树同时替换的单位、结合律得到；空替换唯一给终对象，元组的末尾投影和拼接给理解的三个方程。单位转换给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F_3\">\\(\\mathsf F_3\\)</span>。形成判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(C:\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span> 与以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span> 为类型表达式的同一个统一判断，使 code/El 的两个方向逐代表互逆；这里绝未把类型同构当作判断相等。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span> 的形成、引入、消去、βη 和替换规则分别给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F_5\">\\(\\mathsf F_5\\)</span> 的全部等式。和的规则给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F_6\">\\(\\mathsf F_6\\)</span>；其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 的代表恰是保留前缀并把末尾两个变量配对，因而 β 的替换是同时代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span>，η 是任意许可目标中的项。构造子及其注释的捕获避免替换给严格自然性。由此全部六组公理均有对应验证，模型性不是假设。</p>\n<p>末尾四个恒等式按上下文长度及注释语法树相互归纳。变量投影直接得到变量类，绑定构造解释为对应构造子的类，Type 码经 El 返回原类型类；类型/项商关系与语境转换处理所有代表。该模型为后续完备性提供实际见证，既不是强一阶 DTT 模型的改名，也不把普通 generic 的同构分类唯一性误作严格分类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model","status":"resolved","id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的有限推导关系，省略固定下标 $\\mathrm{FHoDTT}$。语境的声明 $(x_i,s_i,C_i)$ 保留 sort 标签，固定 $V$ 的枚举 $(x_i)_{i\\ge1}$，语境声明变量按位置 $x_i$ 同名；内部绑定变量取 $\\alpha$ 类。$s,t,u\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$。所有商均为集合的商；$[z]_{\\sim}$ 是相应等价类。$[\\Gamma]$、$[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]$ 分别按 $\\approx,\\sim_S$ 取类；$[(\\Gamma,C)]_s$、$[(\\Gamma,C,e)]_s$ 分别按 $\\sim_{A,s},\\sim_{E,s}$ 取类，故方括号的每种论域都有明确关系。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure","status":"resolved","id":"241e7e90b85de13e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"范畴、集合族、重索引和各项操作的目标格式采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]；$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 和递归解释采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]。下式不是把句法模型性放进前提，而是先给全部分量再断言它满足结构公理。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model","status":"resolved","id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"范畴、集合族、重索引和各项操作的目标格式采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]；$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 和递归解释采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]。下式不是把句法模型性放进前提，而是先给全部分量再断言它满足结构公理。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FHoDTT}","display":false},{"tex":"(x_i,s_i,C_i)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"(x_i)_{i\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"s,t,u\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[z]_{\\sim}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Gamma]","display":false},{"tex":"[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\approx,\\sim_S","display":false},{"tex":"[(\\Gamma,C)]_s","display":false},{"tex":"[(\\Gamma,C,e)]_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_{A,s},\\sim_{E,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma\\equiv\\tau:\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{<i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x_{<i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"s_i^\\Gamma,C_i^\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=((x_i,s_i^\\Gamma,C_i^\\Gamma))_{i=1}^{|\\Gamma|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}","display":false},{"tex":"A=[(\\Gamma,C)]_s","display":false},{"tex":"B=[(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D)]_t","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,f,p,d","display":false},{"tex":"(C,x.D,z.E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda x:C.b","display":false},{"tex":"x=x_{|\\Gamma|+1}","display":false},{"tex":"y=x_{|\\Gamma|+2}","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf C&\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}\\mid\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma'&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma,\\Gamma'\\in\\mathsf C\\land|\\Gamma|=|\\Gamma'|\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\Gamma|\\})\\\n\\bigl[s_i^\\Gamma=s_i^{\\Gamma'}\\land\n\\Gamma_{<i}\\vdash C_i^\\Gamma\\equiv C_i^{\\Gamma'}:s_i^\\Gamma\\bigr],\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\vec a\\equiv\\vec b:\\Delta\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\vec a:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\land\\vec b:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\Delta|\\})\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash a_i\\equiv b_i:C_i^\\Delta[\\vec a_{<i}/\\vec x_{<i}],\\\\\n\\mathsf S&\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\mid\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf C\\land\n\\sigma:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf A_s&\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,C)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf C\\land\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf E_s&\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\Gamma,C,e)\\mid(\\Gamma,C)\\in\\mathsf A_s\\land\\Gamma\\vdash e:C\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)\\sim_S(\\Gamma',\\Delta',\\tau)\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma),(\\Gamma',\\Delta',\\tau)\\in\\mathsf S\n\\land\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma'\\land\\Delta\\approx\\Delta'\n\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma\\equiv\\tau:\\Delta,\\\\\n(\\Gamma,C)\\sim_{A,s}(\\Gamma',C')\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,C),(\\Gamma',C')\\in\\mathsf A_s\n\\land\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma'\\land\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv C':s,\\\\\n(\\Gamma,C,e)\\sim_{E,s}(\\Gamma',C',e')\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\Gamma,C,e),(\\Gamma',C',e')\\in\\mathsf E_s\n\\land\\Gamma\\approx\\Gamma'\\land\n\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv C':s\\land\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e':C.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\mathrm g}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf C/{\\approx},\\qquad\nM_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S/{\\sim_S},\\\\\ns_{\\mathrm g}[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]&\\coloneqq[\\Gamma],\\qquad\nt_{\\mathrm g}[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\coloneqq[\\Delta],\\\\\ne_{\\mathrm g}[\\Gamma]&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Gamma,(x_i)_{i=1}^{|\\Gamma|})],\\\\\nc_{\\mathrm g}([(\\Delta',\\Theta,\\tau)],[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)])\n&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\tau[\\sigma])]\n\\quad(\\Delta'\\approx\\Delta),\\\\\n\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm g}&\\coloneqq\n\\langle O_{\\mathrm g},M_{\\mathrm g},s_{\\mathrm g},t_{\\mathrm g},e_{\\mathrm g},c_{\\mathrm g}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq[()],\\\\\n!_{[\\Gamma]}&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(),())],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ty}^{\\mathrm g}_s([\\Gamma])\n&\\coloneqq\\{[(\\Gamma',C)]_{\\sim_{A,s}}\\mid\n(\\Gamma',C)\\in\\mathsf A_s\\land\\Gamma'\\approx\\Gamma\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tm}^{\\mathrm g}_s([\\Gamma],[(\\Gamma,C)])\n&\\coloneqq\n\\{[(\\Gamma',C',e)]_{\\sim_{E,s}}\\mid\n(\\Gamma',C',e)\\in\\mathsf E_s\\land(\\Gamma',C')\\sim_{A,s}(\\Gamma,C)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n[(\\Delta,C)]_s\\bigl[\\,[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\,\\bigr]\n&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,C[\\sigma])]_s,\\\\\n[(\\Delta,C,e)]_s\\bigl[\\,[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]\\,\\bigr]\n&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,C[\\sigma],e[\\sigma])]_s,\\\\\n[\\Gamma]\\triangleright_s[(\\Gamma,C)]_s\n&\\coloneqq[\\Gamma,(x,s,C)],\\\\\np^s_{[(\\Gamma,C)]}&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);\\Gamma;(x_i)_{i=1}^{|\\Gamma|})],\\\\\nq^s_{[(\\Gamma,C)]}&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);C;x)]_s,\\\\\n\\langle[(\\Delta,\\Gamma,\\sigma)],[(\\Delta,C[\\sigma],a)]_s\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq[(\\Delta;\\Gamma,(x,s,C);(\\sigma,a))],\\\\\n1^s_{[\\Gamma]}&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1_s)]_s,\\qquad\n*^s_{[\\Gamma]}\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,1_s,()_s)]_s,\\\\\n\\Omega_{[\\Gamma]}&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type})]_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_{[\\Gamma]}([(\\Gamma,C)]_{\\mathsf{Type}})\n&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type},C)]_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{El}_{[\\Gamma]}([(\\Gamma,\\mathsf{Type},C)]_{\\mathsf{Kind}})\n&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma,C)]_{\\mathsf{Type}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{\\mathrm g}^{s,t}(A,B)&\\coloneqq\n[(\\Gamma,\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C).D)]_t\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n\\lambda^{s,t}_{A,B}([(\\Gamma,(x,s,C);D;b)]_t)\n&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma;\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D;\n\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))]_t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\n[(\\Gamma,\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D,f)]_t,[(\\Gamma,C,a)]_s)\n&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma;D[a/x];\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(f,a))]_t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{A,B}(\n[(\\Gamma,C,a)]_s,[(\\Gamma,D[a/x],b)]_t)\n&\\coloneqq[(\\Gamma;\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D;\n\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))]_t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,[(\\Gamma,(z,t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D);E)]_u}^{s,t,u}\n([(\\Gamma,(x,s,C),(y,t,D);E[(x,y)/z];d)]_u)\n&\\coloneqq\n[(\\Gamma,(z,t,\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D);E;\n\\operatorname{split}_{C,x.D,z.E}^{s,t,u}(z;x,y.d))]_u\n\\quad((s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nS_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm g},\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm g},!,&\n(\\operatorname{Ty}^{\\mathrm g}_s,\\operatorname{Tm}^{\\mathrm g}_s,\n[-],\\triangleright_s,p^s,q^s,\\langle-,-\\rangle,1^s,*^s)_{s\\in\\mathcal S},\\\\\n&\\Omega,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{El},\n(\\Pi_{\\mathrm g}^{s,t},\\lambda^{s,t},\\operatorname{app}^{s,t},\n\\Sigma_{\\mathrm g}^{s,t},\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t})_{s,t\\in\\mathcal S},\n(\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u})_{(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\\rangle .\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S_{\\mathrm g}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}&\\Longrightarrow⟦\\Gamma⟧_{S_{\\mathrm g}}=[\\Gamma],\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash C:s&\\Longrightarrow\n⟦ C⟧^s_{S_{\\mathrm g},\\Gamma}=[(\\Gamma,C)]_s,\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s)\\land(\\Gamma\\vdash e:C)&\\Longrightarrow\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash e:C⟧_{S_{\\mathrm g}}\n=[(\\Gamma,C,e)]_s,\\\\\n\\sigma:\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta&\\Longrightarrow\n⟦\\sigma⟧_{S_{\\mathrm g}}=[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf F_3","display":false},{"tex":"C:\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf F_5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf F_6","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false}],"bytes":9340,"backlinks":[{"id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"普通结构保持原书的范畴接口；严格语境族版本另外以 $\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 明确命名。后续可靠性、完备性对该严格版本量化，其句法商模型与逐规则证明见 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]。不把普通泛对象的同构分类唯一性误作分裂泛对象的严格对象分类。"},{"id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本原子给出形成接口；与项、结构和转换规则合起来的有限推导演算在 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 定义。可选的多型相等扩展应明确选择 [[16-df-identity-type]] 的规则包，不能以 $r$ 引入冒充 equality reflection。与本页规则匹配的严格结构及其可靠性、完备性采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]] 和 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]；普通非分裂模型的相干选择不在该严格版本定理的量词中。"},{"id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是按本书语法草图重建的基础规则呈现；没有加入宇宙累积、独立 Prop、归纳类型或 equality reflection。[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]] 给出匹配的严格语境族模型和递归解释，[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]] 构造其句法商模型；[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 分别给该严格版本的规则归纳与语义反射。普通非分裂范畴模型的相干解释不是这些定理的量词范围。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]、[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]、[[16-df-dtt-model]]、[[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]]、[[16-df-term-model]]、[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]、[[16-df-dtt-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-dtt-completeness]]、[[16-df-identity-type]]、[[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]、[[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]]、[[16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection]]。DTT 结果使用明确的强片段与严格态射；FHoDTT 的可靠性和完备性使用匹配其语法的两 sort 严格模型。内部语言评价是否覆盖整个模型，由语境生成条件判定。"},{"id":"32520a37e4beb365","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm g}$ 是 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]] 显式构造的两 sort 句法商模型；模型量词的宇宙包含它。类型、项以及语境均按该页给出的判断相等关系取商；不能把类型同构当作判断相等。"}],"outgoing":["3930e297a315728a","f94e7143755d4851","241e7e90b85de13e"]}